Topic: Command Task (Leader Test) 👑🔥

👉 This is the most powerful GTO task
👉 Here, you are the COMMANDER

1️⃣ What is Command Task?

👉 You will be given:

One obstacle
Some helping materials (rope, plank, etc.)

👉 Your role:
✅ Lead the task
✅ Select 1–2 subordinates (helpers)
✅ Complete obstacle

🧗 Example Command Task
2️⃣ What GTO Checks

👉 This task directly tests your:

Leadership
Decision making
Confidence
Ability to command
Responsibility

💥 This is your officer moment

3️⃣ Step-by-Step Strategy
🔹 Step 1: Understand Obstacle
Observe carefully
Ask doubts (if any)

👉 Shows: clarity + confidence

🔹 Step 2: Select Subordinates

👉 Choose:

Cooperative members
Not your close friends only

💥 Smart selection = leadership

🔹 Step 3: Give Clear Instructions

👉 Speak like leader:

“Hold the rope firmly”
“Place plank here”

✅ Clear + calm voice

🔹 Step 4: Execute Plan
Guide team step-by-step
Stay involved

👉 Don’t stand idle ❌

🔹 Step 5: Complete Task

👉 Ensure:

Everyone crosses
Rules followed
🧠 GOLDEN RULE

👉 Leader = Think + Decide + Execute

4️⃣ How to Speak (VERY IMPORTANT)

❌ “Maybe we can try…”
❌ “I think…”

✅ “We will do this…”
✅ “Place the plank here”

💥 Be confident, not arrogant

5️⃣ Common Mistakes

❌ No clear plan
❌ Confused instructions
❌ Choosing wrong teammates
❌ Not involving helpers
❌ Breaking rules

6️⃣ PRO STRATEGY (SELECTION SECRET)

👉 Show these qualities:

Quick decision making
Clear communication
Responsibility
Confidence

💥 Don’t panic if plan fails
👉 Change plan calmly

7️⃣ Behavior Tips

✅ Be calm under pressure
✅ Respect subordinates
✅ Encourage team
✅ Stay active

8️⃣ Practice Task (IMPORTANT)

Imagine:

👉 You are commander
👉 You have:

Rope + plank
👉 Gap to cross

Answer:
1️⃣ What is your plan?
2️⃣ What instructions will you give?

🧠 SECRET TIP

👉 GTO may increase difficulty or confuse you

💥 They are checking:

Your reaction under pressure

👉 Stay calm = selected

